# Conformance probe pack for the range check of a count whose group is not
# written (spec 0.21 ruling 30), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   n           an 8-bit count: the number of nums minus 1 (`plus -1`)
#   opt         one bit, then 7 unused bits and the n + 1 nums (val in 8
#               bits) when it is 1
format     conformance-extents-unreached-minus
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
count n 8 plus -1
opt
  pad 7
  group  probe.nums count @n
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
